2026-07-27T12:00:22.8465113Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:00:22.8465611Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:00:22.8466377Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:00:22.8467523Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:00:22.8468943Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
